{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46209","headline":"山居诗二十四首 二十三 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如愚何止直如弦，只合深藏碧嶂前。\n但见山中常有雪，不知世上是何年。\n野人爱向庵前笑，赤玃频来袖畔眠。\n只有逍遥好知己，何须更问洞中天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}